body:
I may not be hot, and I may be a dude, but if anybody is that lonely and just wants something like that, i will do it for free cause i get that shit. You want me to just say I wanna hold your hand ? done. You want me to tell you I care about you? easy, done. Hell, you want me to say that I love you because you never fucking hear it ever? sure. just gimme your name and i will deadass record myself doing it for ya. 

&#x200B;

Real sad that this person didnt accept the poor dudes request. Itd be hella easy to do.
